  <section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="span-5">
          <h2 id="about-h">About</h2>
          <p class="t-lead">I build backend APIs in Java and Spring Boot, full-stack web apps in TypeScript, and containerized deployment pipelines.</p>
          <p>Work spans a Spring Boot e-commerce backend showcase with PostgreSQL, Redis, and RabbitMQ, a Kubernetes and ArgoCD GitOps setup, and shipped web platforms for Team ALAZ #12368, Rıdvan Otel, and Çiğli SKAL. On the side, I build hobby audio and systems projects in Rust.</p>
          <ul class="about-facts">
            <li>GitHub: {PROFILE.handle} ({PROFILE.repoCount} public repositories)</li>
            <li>Core languages: Java, TypeScript</li>
            <li>Backend &amp; Web: Spring Boot, Next.js, React, PostgreSQL, Redis, RabbitMQ</li>
            <li>DevOps &amp; Infra: Docker, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions (CI/CD), Linux, ArgoCD, OpenTofu</li>
            <li>Other &amp; Hobby: Python / Django (shipped), Rust (hobby)</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="about-links">
            <a class="link" href={PROFILE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
            <a class="link" href={PROFILE.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
            <a class="link" href={`mailto:${PROFILE.email}`}>Send email</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="frame frame--split span-6 start-7">
          <div class="dg" data-diagram data-dg-still data-icon-base="/assets/icons">
            <script type="application/json" set:html={stackDiagram} />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

